### Manage Tools endpoints (JWT) ###

### List tools for an INTEGRATION connector (identity ignored)
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/telegram/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Get a single tool of an INTEGRATION connector
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/telegram/sendMessage
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### List tools for an INTERNAL_SERVICE connector
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/board/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### List tools for an APP connector — identity required
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/{{appConnectorCode}}/?identity={{appPubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Get a single tool of an APP connector
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/{{appConnectorCode}}/{{toolName}}?identity={{appPubId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### APP without identity → 400
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/{{appConnectorCode}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Unknown connector → 404
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/__missing__/
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Without JWT → 401
GET http://localhost:8180/device/manage/tools/telegram/
